/T ( Sterile Supply Distribution and Inventory Management! CSSD is responsible for distributing sterile supplies to operating rooms, endoscopy suites, and patient care units, ensuring timely availability for both routine and emergency procedures. Inventory management is another crucial function, where the department tracks and maintains stock levels to prevent shortages, ensuring cost-effectiveness and minimizing waste.)
/E ( Sterile Supply Distribution and Inventory Management! CSSD is responsible for distributing sterile supplies to operating rooms, endoscopy suites, and patient care units, ensuring timely availability for both routine and emergency procedures. Inventory management is another crucial function, where the department tracks and maintains stock levels to prevent shortages, ensuring cost-effectiveness and minimizing waste.)
