<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (On October 16, 2024, the Cancer Institute celebrated World Anesthesia Day with the theme "Workforce Well-Being," emphasizing the essential role of anesthesia in cancer treatment. The event, held on October 19, featured a variety of engaging activities, including a quiz competition, a poetry writing contest \("Lyrical Lustre"\), a painting competition, and the "Pulpit" talk series.)
